<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Crank</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>crank              the ranks of your clan, from the lowest up
crank &lt;player&gt;     the rank a player holds in their clan
</pre>
<p>Example:
</p>
<pre>crank fizban
</pre>
<p>With no name, crank lists the titles of your clan's ranks. With a name, it 
tells you the rank that player holds, and in which clan. Anyone can look 
up another player's rank, in a clan or not; the player must be in the 
game. The clan Master and Lords choose the titles of the ranks (see 
<a cmd='#'>Help Csrank</a>) and set members' ranks (see <a cmd='#'>Help Cpromote</a>).
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Csrank</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Cpromote</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Cinfo</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Clan Commands</a>
</pre>




</div>